<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Help Centre - CineHub</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #222;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .page-header {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .page-header p {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #d1d5db;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 760px;
        }

        .page-header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 34px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 30px 0 14px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .doc-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .doc-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .doc-card h3 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .doc-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .doc-id {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .doc-link {
            display: inline-block;
            align-self: flex-start;
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .doc-link:hover {
            background: #374151;
        }

        .contact-card {
            margin-top: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 26px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .contact-card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .contact-item strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .contact-item a {
            color: #111827;
        }

        .note {
            margin-top: 16px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .doc-grid,
            .contact-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .navbar {
                padding: 18px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<nav class="navbar">
    <strong>🎬 CineHub</strong>

    <div>
        <a href="{{ path('home') }}">Movies</a>
        {% if app.user %}
            <a href="{{ path('my_bookings') }}">My Bookings</a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_profile') }}">Profile</a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}">Logout</a>
        {% else %}
            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}">Login</a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_register') }}">Register</a>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</nav>

<main class="container">

    <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Help Centre</h1>
        <p>
            Find clear answers about accounts, bookings, cancellations, privacy,
            and contacting support. All documents are available as PDF downloads
            and can be opened in a new tab.
        </p>
    </header>

    <h2 class="section-title">Policies</h2>

    <div class="doc-grid">

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">POL-001</span>
            <h3>Terms of Service</h3>
            <p>
                The rules for using CineHub, including account eligibility,
                bookings, cancellation, payments, and liability.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/policies/POL-001-terms-of-service.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">POL-002</span>
            <h3>Privacy, Cookies and Data Retention</h3>
            <p>
                What data CineHub collects, why it is used, how long it is kept,
                and how to make a privacy request.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/policies/POL-002-privacy-cookies-data-retention-policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">POL-003</span>
            <h3>Account and Registration Policy</h3>
            <p>
                Registration requirements, password rules, the 10-account limit,
                login help, and account closure.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/policies/POL-003-account-registration-policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">POL-004</span>
            <h3>Booking, Seat and Cancellation Policy</h3>
            <p>
                How bookings work, seat selection, the 3-confirmed-booking limit,
                pricing, cancellation, and refunds.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/policies/POL-004-booking-seat-cancellation-policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Support</h2>

    <div class="doc-grid">

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">SUP-001</span>
            <h3>Customer Support and Contact Guide</h3>
            <p>
                How to contact support, what details to include, response times,
                escalation, privacy requests, and security reporting.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/support/SUP-001-customer-support-contact-guide.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">SUP-002</span>
            <h3>FAQ and Troubleshooting</h3>
            <p>
                Quick answers for registration, login, booking limits, seat
                availability, cancellation, refunds, privacy, and support.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/support/SUP-002-faq-troubleshooting.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="doc-card">
            <span class="doc-id">SUP-003</span>
            <h3>System Capabilities and Limitations</h3>
            <p>
                What the current CineHub application does and does not do, so you
                know exactly which features and limits apply.
            </p>
            <a class="doc-link" href="/documents/support/SUP-003-system-capabilities-limitations.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                Download PDF
            </a>
        </article>

    </div>

    <section class="contact-card">
        <h2>Contact us</h2>

        <div class="contact-grid">
            <div class="contact-item">
                <strong>General support</strong>
                <a href="mailto:support@cinehub.example">support@cinehub.example</a>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-item">
                <strong>Privacy requests</strong>
                <a href="mailto:privacy@cinehub.example">privacy@cinehub.example</a>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-item">
                <strong>Phone and hours</strong>
                <a href="tel:+910000000000">+91 00000 00000</a><br>
                Mon-Sat, 10:00-18:00 IST
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="note">
            For booking issues, include your booking reference, the movie,
            theatre, screen, and showtime. CineHub will never ask for your
            password, card number, or UPI PIN.
        </p>
    </section>

</main>

{% include 'partials/jwt_expiry_guard.html.twig' %}
{% include 'partials/site_footer.html.twig' %}

</body>
</html>
